<title>NETHERLANDS: SUBSCRIPTION DUTCH CSS SHARES CLOSES EARLIER.</title>
<headline>SUBSCRIPTION DUTCH CSS SHARES CLOSES EARLIER.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The subscription to the shares of Dutch firm Computer Services Holding NV (CSS) will close one day earlier than planned on April 24, 0900 GMT, CSS and lead manager Rabo Securities said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The joint statement said the issue had been oversubscribed several times.</p>
<p>The final price and allotment of the shares are expected to be announced on Friday, April 25. CSS earlier said the shares would be priced in a range between 15 and 17 guilders.</p>
<p>CSS will be floated on the New Market of the Amsterdam Stock Exchange (NMAX).</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
